---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---
<Base
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of use and general financial information disclaimer for Howloop calculators, CDR banking data snapshots, and educational guides."
>
  <div class="hl-wrap hl-prose-wrap">
    <article class="hl-prose">
      <h1>Terms of Use</h1>
      <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> October 2026 · <strong>Website:</strong> <a href={SITE.url}>{SITE.domain}</a></p>

      <div class="hl-policy-callout">
        <strong>General Financial Information Disclaimer:</strong> All calculators, projections, banking data snapshots, and written guides on {SITE.name} are provided for general educational and informational purposes only. Nothing on this website constitutes personal financial, taxation, legal, or credit advice.
      </div>

      <h2>1. No Financial Services Licence or Fiduciary Relationship</h2>
      <p>
        {SITE.name} does not hold an Australian Financial Services Licence (AFSL) or an Australian Credit Licence (ACL). Our calculators apply simplified mathematical models to user-entered assumptions and do not account for your individual objectives, financial situation, or needs. Before making any financial decision, you should review the relevant Product Disclosure Statement (PDS), Target Market Determination (TMD), and consult a registered tax agent or licensed financial adviser.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Accuracy of Calculators &amp; Public CDR Data</h2>
      <p>
        While we test our formulas against published Australian Taxation Office (ATO) schedules and retrieve banking snapshots from the official Consumer Data Right (CDR) register, bank interest rates, fees, and eligibility rules change frequently without notice. We make no warranty that any rate snapshot is real-time or covers the whole market.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Acceptable Use &amp; Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>
        You may use {SITE.name} calculators and export your personal plans (including CSV exports) for personal, non-commercial household planning. Automated scraping or commercial redistribution of our original guides and illustrations without attribution is prohibited.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by Australian Consumer Law, {SITE.name} and its contributors are not liable for any loss or damage arising from reliance on calculator outputs, rate snapshots, or guide content.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions regarding these terms may be sent to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
